### NowPass 后端接口调试集（IntelliJ HTTP Client / VS Code REST Client）
### 用法：先执行「获取验证码」与「登录」，token 会自动写入全局变量。
### 本地图形验证码的答案存在 Redis 里，联调时可用：
###   docker exec nowpass-redis redis-cli get "captcha:<uuid>"

@base = http://127.0.0.1:18090
@adminUser = admin
@adminPass = Admin@123456

### 1) 获取图形验证码
# @name captcha
GET {{base}}/api/auth/captcha

> {%
    client.global.set("captchaUuid", response.body.data.uuid);
    client.log("captcha uuid = " + response.body.data.uuid);
%}

### 2) 登录（把 captchaCode 换成 Redis 里取到的答案）
# @name login
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{adminUser}}",
  "password": "{{adminPass}}",
  "captchaUuid": "{{captchaUuid}}",
  "captchaCode": "REPLACE_WITH_REDIS_ANSWER"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("token", response.body.data.token);
    client.log("token = " + response.body.data.token);
%}

### 3) 当前登录用户
GET {{base}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4) 题目分页（筛选：分类 / 难度 / 标签 / 关键词）
GET {{base}}/api/questions?page=1&pageSize=10&difficulty=medium&tag=jvm&keyword=HashMap
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5) 题目详情（不含标准答案）
GET {{base}}/api/questions/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6) 标准答案（独立接口）
GET {{base}}/api/questions/2/answer
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7) 分类列表（含题目数）
GET {{base}}/api/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8) 发送注册邮箱验证码（需先获取 captcha）
POST {{base}}/api/auth/email-code
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "someone@example.com",
  "scene": "register",
  "captchaUuid": "{{captchaUuid}}",
  "captchaCode": "REPLACE_WITH_REDIS_ANSWER"
}

### 9) 注册（邮箱验证码；注册后为 pending 需管理员审批）
POST {{base}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "tester01",
  "password": "Tester@123456",
  "nickname": "测试用户",
  "email": "someone@example.com",
  "emailCode": "123456"
}

### 10) 找回密码
POST {{base}}/api/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "someone@example.com",
  "emailCode": "123456",
  "newPassword": "Fresh@123456"
}

### 11) 修改昵称
PUT {{base}}/api/user/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nickname": "新昵称"
}

### 12) 修改密码（成功后全部会话失效）
PUT {{base}}/api/user/password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "oldPassword": "Admin@123456",
  "newPassword": "Admin@1234567"
}

### ============ 后台接口（需 admin / superadmin） ============

### 20) 后台题目列表
GET {{base}}/api/admin/questions?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 21) 新增题目（简答题）
POST {{base}}/api/admin/questions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryId": 5,
  "difficulty": "easy",
  "title": "Kotlin 中 val 与 var 的区别？",
  "contentMd": "请说明 `val` 与 `var` 的区别。",
  "answerMd": "`val` 是只读引用，`var` 是可变引用；`val` 不代表对象不可变。",
  "options": null,
  "answerKey": null,
  "tags": ["kotlin", "语法"]
}

### 22) 新增题目（选择题，选项与答案键必须成对）
POST {{base}}/api/admin/questions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryId": 5,
  "difficulty": "easy",
  "title": "Kotlin 中哪个关键字声明只读引用？",
  "contentMd": "选出正确项。",
  "answerMd": "**A**。`val` 声明只读引用。",
  "options": [
    { "key": "A", "text": "val" },
    { "key": "B", "text": "var" },
    { "key": "C", "text": "const" }
  ],
  "answerKey": "A",
  "tags": ["kotlin"]
}

### 23) 编辑题目
PUT {{base}}/api/admin/questions/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryId": 1,
  "difficulty": "medium",
  "title": "== 和 equals() 的区别是什么？（已修订）",
  "contentMd": "题干",
  "answerMd": "答案",
  "options": null,
  "answerKey": null,
  "tags": ["java"]
}

### 24) 删除题目（逻辑删除）
DELETE {{base}}/api/admin/questions/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 25) 分类管理
GET {{base}}/api/admin/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
POST {{base}}/api/admin/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "新分类",
  "sort": 99
}

### 26) 用户列表（status=pending 即待审批）
GET {{base}}/api/admin/users?page=1&pageSize=10&status=pending
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 27) 管理员建号
POST {{base}}/api/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "u_by_admin",
  "password": "Abcd123456",
  "nickname": "后台建的号",
  "email": "u_by_admin@example.com",
  "roleKey": "user"
}

### 28) 审批 / 停用
PUT {{base}}/api/admin/users/2/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "active"
}

### 29) 改角色
PUT {{base}}/api/admin/users/2/role
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roleKey": "admin"
}

### 30) 重置用户密码
PUT {{base}}/api/admin/users/2/reset-password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "newPassword": "NewPass123456"
}

### 31) 删除用户
DELETE {{base}}/api/admin/users/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 32) 在线会话
GET {{base}}/api/admin/online
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 33) 强制下线
DELETE {{base}}/api/admin/online/REPLACE_WITH_TOKEN_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 34) 操作日志
GET {{base}}/api/admin/oper-logs?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 35) 登出
POST {{base}}/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 36) OpenAPI JSON（无需登录）
GET {{base}}/v3/api-docs
